## TC-MAN-01 one-command start (README) — passed (existing install; not a fresh clone)
$ pnpm dev   (README.md "pnpm dev"; ports 3000/5173/3100/5174 were free before)
- build:packages → db:prepare (ensure-env: apps/api/.env exists; prisma generate; migrate deploy: "No pending migrations") → api + web via concurrently
- curl http://localhost:3000/api/health → {"status":"ok"}; curl http://localhost:5173/api/health (vite proxy) → {"status":"ok"}
- Nest mapped exactly: GET /api/health, POST /api/games, GET /api/games, GET /api/games/:id, POST /api/games/:id/commands
- "/" opened in the browser, RU, main menu with Новая партия / Продолжить / Настройки + "Недавние партии" (2 earlier dev games).
Limitation: not a clean clone / fresh `pnpm install` (existing node_modules).

## TC-MAN-02 dev DB recreated automatically — not_run
Reason: would require deleting the user's apps/api/dev.db (destructive to local data); not done. Equivalent path (fresh DB + migrate deploy) is exercised by e2e-serve on every `pnpm e2e` (qa-verify.log).

## TC-MAN-03 scenarios 1–8 quick pass — passed
1 New game: /games/new → radios have names (Империя/Повстанцы, AI/Человек за столом, Лёгкая/Обычная/Сложная); "Начать партию" disabled until a side is chosen; Империя + Сложная → /games/ff6adda5-… ; header "Империя против AI · Сложная", "Раунд 1", "Фаза: Назначение", button "Завершить фазу (mock)", MOCK badge.
3 Table: 10 systems with adjacency lines, filled (Empire) / outlined (Rebel) placeholder shapes, one "?" hidden piece. Wheel up: scale 0.702 → 0.772; drag on empty background: viewport x/y +90/+60, selection (pc-02) kept. zoom buttons aria-label: Приблизить / Отдалить / Вписать карту; zoom-level "77%".
4 Selection: click on Аурелис → selection {system, sys-aurelis}, context-panel data-state=system; panel: region, neighbours (Бревора, Синдрал), 5 objects, group move "Переместить все мои (5) в: Бревора / Синдрал", note "Цели рассчитаны временными правилами (mock)". Click on piece pc-01 → selection piece, highlighted [sys-brevora, sys-cindral], action buttons exactly action-move-pc-01-sys-brevora / -sys-cindral.
5 Move: (a) illegal drag pc-01 → Довмарен (non-adjacent): 0 POST /commands, piece back at the same screen position, snackbar + aria-live "Нельзя переместить в Довмарен: нет допустимого хода", version stays 1. (b) drag pc-01 → Бревора: 1 POST, piece-item-pc-01 data-system-id=sys-brevora, version 2, live "Крейсер → Бревора", log "Империя: Крейсер — Аурелис → Бревора". (c) actions panel: pc-02 → "Синдрал" (1 click) → sys-cindral, version 3, save-status=saved.
7 Mock phase ×3 → phase assignment, "Раунд 2", version 6.
6 Reload of /games/:id → version 6, pc-01 Бревора, pc-02 Синдрал, phase assignment, round 2, 6 log items. "/" → Продолжить → same game, version 6.
8 Settings: English → <html lang=en>, localStorage swr.settings.v1 = {"language":"en","reduceMotion":false}; no Cyrillic in body text on /settings, /, /games/new, /games/:id. (Language reset to ru afterwards.)
Console errors during the session: none (read_console_messages onlyErrors → "No console logs").

